WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,250 --> 00:00:04,970
Hinanap at hinanap, hinanap at hinanap

2
00:00:04,970 --> 00:00:06,130
Nian Wala na si Nian

3
00:00:06,130 --> 00:00:07,570
Dito nagtatapos ang usaping ito

4
00:00:07,890 --> 00:00:09,090
simula ngayon

5
00:00:09,090 --> 00:00:17,830
Ang aming pamilya Shen ay mayroon lamang isang anak na babae, si Pearl, si Xiao Mo

6
00:00:17,830 --> 00:00:19,660
Miss na miss mo na ako

7
00:00:19,660 --> 00:00:20,660
Napakagaan ng loob ko

8
00:00:21,320 --> 00:00:22,840
Ngunit ang taong nangyari ay namatay na

9
00:00:22,840 --> 00:00:24,200
Tumigil ka na lang sa gulo

10
00:00:24,620 --> 00:00:26,660
Bukas na ang kasal namin

11
00:00:27,870 --> 00:00:29,270
Bagama't wala na si Nian Nian

12
00:00:29,270 --> 00:00:30,830
Pero hindi masisira ang legato

13
00:00:31,070 --> 00:00:37,190
